数比这个理想的结果, 可能原因为（填空）(多选)\nA. 原线圈的输入功率小于副线圈的输出功率\nB. 绕制线圈的导线有电阻\nC. 穿过原线圈的磁通量大于穿过副线圈的磁通量\nD. 原、副线圈两端电压随时间正弦变化的相位不同"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（I、II、III三题共14分）\n14-I. (5 分)\n(1) B.....1 分\n(2) 1.5……2 分\n（3）不是……1分\n(4) C.....1 分\n14-II. (5 分)\n（1）500……1 分；串联……1 分；2500……1 分\n（2）未考虑新电池的内阻……1分；大……1分。\n14-III.（4分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":".....1 分；"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":".....1 分\n(2) B、C……2 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502","source_question_id":"qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d73072eed49917ed9034f0049eaaf8494603bbf8f20dcf89e65727926d24e732","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）如图所示，一质量为 M 的导热汽缸，用质量为 m 的活塞封着一定质量的理想气体，活塞通过细绳悬挂在升降机的天花板上。开始时汽缸处于静止状态，空气柱长为 l，若升降机以加速度 a 向上加速，运动稳定后，再使气体温度逐渐降低。当温度达到 T 时，空气柱又恢复到原长 l。已知活塞横截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=100cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"a=5m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，l=7cm， "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}pa"},{"type":"text","value":" ，M=20kg，m=2kg，开始时温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}=300K"},{"type":"text","value":" ，活塞与汽缸之间无摩擦且不漏气， "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。则\n(1)汽缸由静止到加速运动稳定过程中,气体分子的平均动能（填空）(选填“增加”、“减小”或“不变”),气体的分子数密度（填空）(选填“增加”、“减小”或“不变”);\n(2) 温度 T;\n（3）若在温度由 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 降至 T 的过程中，气体的内能减少 20J，则该过程气体热量的变化量 Q。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1c0281c4e95dd9a3df2751881ceee03553c2511ec1393a84147b8c4a525e3e79.png","width":280,"height":317,"width_mm":32.756,"row_group":"qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8 分）\n(1) 不变；……1分\n减小……1分\n(2) 对汽缸：静止时，"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S=p_{1}S+Mg"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=0.8\\times10^{5}pa"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n向上加速时，"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S-p_{2}S-Mg=Ma"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=0.7\\times10^{5}pa"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n加速稳定后，由等温变化，"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}lS=p_{2}l'S \\quad l'=\\frac{p_{1}}{p_{2}}l"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"l'=8cm"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n温度降低过程中，由等压变化，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{l'S}{T_{0}}=\\frac{lS}{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"得 T=262.5K ……1分\n(3) 外界对气体做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=p_{2}S(l'-l)=7J"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n由热力学第一定律，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q"},{"type":"text","value":"得 Q=-27J 放出热量 27J ……1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502","source_question_id":"qicai-yangguang-lianmeng-2502-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2fdfacd2862dff0c75741d11b8fbc2117f48045ddd056baf0a0307cfbf863e3e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）某场地利用传送带、滑板等装置自动运输货物至轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"IJ"},{"type":"text","value":" 。该装置由圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 的四分之一圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" ，水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" ，倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 竖直放置的传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"CE"},{"type":"text","value":" ，水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"IJ"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成。滑板静止在 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 上，其上表面与 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 相平，左端紧靠竖直边 "},{"type":"math","value":"FG"},{"type":"text","value":" ，传送带以速度 "},{"type":"math"